---
import Module7Behold from './Module7Behold';
import Module7Derive from './Module7Derive';
import Module7Operate from './Module7Operate';
import Module7Prompts from './Module7Prompts';
---

<div class="m m7">
  <section class="m-block m7-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">behold</p>
    <p>
      Forget keys for a moment. Consider just the twenty-four
      consonant triads (twelve major, twelve minor) and ask: what's
      the shortest path from any one to any other? Hugo Riemann's
      answer is three rules — <strong>P</strong>, <strong>L</strong>,
      <strong>R</strong> — each moving exactly one voice by a half or
      whole step.
    </p>
    <Module7Behold client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m7-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">derive</p>
    <p>
      <strong>P</strong> swaps major and minor on the same root.
      <strong>L</strong> exchanges a major triad with the minor triad
      a major third above (and vice versa), sharing two pitches.
      <strong>R</strong> takes a major triad to its relative minor.
      Each is an <em>involution</em> — apply twice and you're back
      where you started.
    </p>
    <Module7Derive client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m7-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">operate</p>
    <p>
      A PLR lab. Start on C major; tap P, L, or R to walk through
      neighboring triads and hear each landing on the piano. The
      chain shows your path; reset returns to C. Try{' '}
      <code>P L P L P L</code> and notice that six moves return you
      home — the hexatonic cycle, Liszt's favorite trick.
    </p>
    <Module7Operate client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m7-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">prompt</p>
    <p class="m-prompt-intro">
      Two cards on PLR semantics.
    </p>
    <Module7Prompts client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m7-block m-bridge m7-bridge">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">bridge</p>
    <p>
      PLR moves discretely between consonant triads. But voice leading
      lives in a continuous space — any pitch can slide by any amount.
      The next module embeds chord-space directly as a geometry, where
      the most efficient voice leadings are <em>geodesics</em>.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

<style is:global>
  /* Module 7 specific rules. */

  /* Behold ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m7-behold {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    max-width: 360px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .m7-behold-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .m7-behold-name {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m7-behold-op {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m7-behold-caption {
    font-size: 0.92rem !important;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
    max-width: 40ch;
  }

  /* Derive ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m7-derive {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m7-derive-controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
  }
  .m7-derive-control {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .m7-derive-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    width: 5.5rem;
  }
  .m7-derive-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .m7-pick {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.55rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m7-pick:hover:not(.active) {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m7-pick.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m7-pick-op {
    min-width: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .m7-derive-pair {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m7-derive-side {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }
  .m7-derive-name {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m7-derive-arrow {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .m7-derive-caption {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    font-size: 0.92rem !important;
    max-width: 48ch;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
  }
  .m7-derive-caption strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Operate --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m7-operate {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m7-op-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .m7-op-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m7-op-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m7-op-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .m7-op-reset {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.95rem;
  }
  .m7-chain {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    justify-content: center;
    max-width: 480px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .m7-chain-step {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  .m7-chain-op {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }
  .m7-chain-name {
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .m7-chain-name.current {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m7-operate-caption {
    font-size: 0.92rem !important;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 48ch;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
  }
</style>
